{
  "id": "overnight-01-linear-scale",
  "exportName": "scaleLinearAmount",
  "objective": "Implement pure exported scaleLinearAmount(amount:number,originalServings:number,targetServings:number):number. All arguments must be finite numbers; amount>=0 and servings>0. Compute ratio=targetServings/originalServings then result=amount*ratio. Throw for nonfinite or zero ratio, nonfinite result, or positive amount becoming zero through underflow. Return unchanged with NO rounding, preserving tiny quantities. Zero amount returns zero when ratio valid. Only for explicitly linear ingredients; no units/public text/manual quantities. No imports, side effects or external resources.",
